&#2366;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Sparse is the antonym of dense, similarly disperse is the antonym of gather.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option which is related to the third term in the same way as the second term is related to the first term.</p><p>Austria : Vienna :: New Zealand : ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342;, &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>&#2321;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; : &#2357;&#2367;&#2351;&#2344;&#2366; :: &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2332;&#2364;&#2368;&#2354;&#2376;&#2339;&#2381;&#2337; : ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Dunedin</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2337;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2337;&#2367;&#2344;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Auckland</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2321;&#2325;&#2354;&#2376;&#2306;&#2337;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Wellington</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2375;&#2354;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327;&#2381;&#2335;&#2344;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Hamilton</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2376;&#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2381;&#2335;&#2344;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Austria : Vienna (Capital of Austria) :: New Zealand : Wellington (Capital of New Zealand)</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option which is related to the first term in the same way as the fourth term is related to the third term</p><p><b>Rake : ? : : Scalpel : Doctor</b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2330;&#2380;&#2341;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;</p><p><b>Rake : ? : : Scalpel : Doctor</b></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Teacher</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Teacher</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Chef</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Chef</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Gardener</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Gardener</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Baker</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Baker</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Scalpel is used by a doctor for surgery and a rake is used by a gardener.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option that is related to the third word in the same way as the second word is related to the first word.</p><p>Editorial : Newspaper :: Prologue : ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;