ution":"<p>Robust is the antonym for weak in the same way converge is the antonym for Diverge.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the following question, find out the alternative which will replace the question mark.</p><p>Incisors : Molars :: ? : ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2379; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2327;&#2366;&#2404;</p><p>Incisors : Molars :: ? : ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Shirts : Trousers</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Shirts : Trousers</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Bags : Satchels</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Bags : Satchels</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Natural : Whole</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Natural : Whole</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Racquet : Basket</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Racquet : Basket</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Incisors and molars are two (out of four) types of human teeth. Similarly, natural and whole are two types of numbers in the number system.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option which shows the word pair which is related to each other in the same way as the word pair given below.</p><p><b>Ant : Army</b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p><b>Ant : Army</b></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Lion : Herd</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Lion : Herd</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Bee : Swarm</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Bee : Swarm</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Fish : Flock</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Fish : Flock</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Elephant : Parliament</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Elephant : Parliament</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>A group of ants is called an army and similarly a group of bees is called a swarm.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>\"Cruel\" is related to \"Benevolent\" in the same way \"Serene\" is related to:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>\"Cruel\" &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; \"Benevolent\" &#2360;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; \"Serene\" &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; '__________' &#2360;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Calm</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Calm</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Agitated</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Agitated</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Blissful</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Blissful</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Mischievous</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Mischievous</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Cruel is the antonym for Benevolent similarly serene is the antonym of agitated.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Each question contains a pair of words. Find the relationship between these two words. Then choose from the options given in the which the relationship is almost similar.</p><p>URANIUM: NUCLEAR POWER PLANT</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2332;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; &#2340;&#2379; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2354;&#2327;&#2349;&#2327; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>&#2351;&#2370;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;: &#2346;&#2352;&#2350;&#2366;&#2339;&#2369; &#2314;&#2352;&#2381;&#2332;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2306;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Coal: Washery</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2379;&#2351;&#2354;&#2366;: &#2357;&#2366;&#2358;&#2352;&#2368;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Sand: Sea</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2366;&#2354;&#2370;: &#2360;&#2350;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Coal: Thermal power plant</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2379;&#2351;&#2354;&#2366;: &#2340;&#2366;&#2346; &#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2340; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2306;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Steam: Furnace</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2349;&#2366;&#2346;: &#2349;&#2335;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Given analogy URANIUM: NUCLEAR POWER PLANT. Uranium is one of the basic fuels for the nuclear power plants.</p><p>Option a: Washery is place where coal is washed, it is not depicting the given analogy.</p><p>Option b: sand and sea do not depict the required relationship.</p><p>Option c: Coal is one of the basic fuels for the thermal power plants.</p><p>Option d: Steam and furnace are also not depicting the required relationship.</p><p>Hence only option c is correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option which is related to the third term in the same way as the second term is related to the first term.</p><p><b>Cajon : Hand : : Harmonica : ?</b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p><b>&#2325;&#2376;&#2332;&#2344; : &#2361;&#2366;&#2341; : : &#2361;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2379;&#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366; : ?</b></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Mouth</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2369;&#2305;&#2361;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Feet</s